<title>MEXICO: Penoles Q1 net profit rises. [CORRECTED 01:19 29/04 GMT]</title>
<headline>Penoles Q1 net profit rises. [CORRECTED 01:19 29/04 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to show that profit rose rather than fell.)</p>
<p>			     Q1 1997			 Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  281.52 million	     270.44 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 1.692 bln		1.779 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     677.11 million	     793.81 million</p>
<p>     Oper profit	355.61 million	     482.65 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   58.476 million	     86.439 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    54.23 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    FX loss     7.424 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    Int earned  63.07 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    57.065 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Industrias Penoles SA.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
